          "text": "እሷም ወስዳ ለናቷ ሰጠች ግ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዳይ ጣለች ። ሐተታ ትሰፋም ት",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true,
          "stage1_text": "ዳይ ጣለች ። ሐተታ ትሰፉም ት",
          "stage2_correction": {
            "pair": "ፉ -> ፋ",
            "reason": "Amharic imperfective verb is ትሰፋም (from መስፋት 'to sew', paired with ትፈትልም 'she spins'); the 4th-order ፋ was misread as 2nd-order ፉ."
