          "stage1_text": "ንቡን ሠጥቃ ወጥታ ጌታ ዘደ",
          "stage2_correction": {
            "pair": "ዘ -> በ",
            "reason": "The Amharic locative preposition is በደብረ ዘይት ('while the Lord was teaching on the Mount of Olives'); the glyph is clearly በ, not ዘ."
